<title>GREECE: COMMERCIAL BANK ATMS OUT OF ORDER ON SUNDAY.</title>
<headline>COMMERCIAL BANK ATMS OUT OF ORDER ON SUNDAY.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>STate Commercial Bank said its automated teller machine (ATM) network will be out of order on Sunday between the hours of 06:00-10:00 for a technical upgrade.</p>
<p>--George Georgiopoulos, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
